1
00:00:00,957 --> 00:00:03,587
(Penny:)Come on, Sheldon. Just give it a try.

2
00:00:05,378 --> 00:00:07,258
(Sheldon:)All right.

3
00:00:09,632 --> 00:00:13,132
There. Nice and comfy-cozy.
Zero, zero, zero.

4
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:16,310
(Sheldon:)There's one more zero.

5
00:00:16,848 --> 00:00:19,098
(Sheldon:)You forgot the time parameter.

6
00:00:19,267 --> 00:00:20,807
(Penny:)Sit on the damn couch.

7
00:00:44,751 --> 00:00:46,291
(Sheldon:)Nope.

8
00:00:48,046 --> 00:00:50,176
What do you mean "nope"?
What's wrong with it?

9
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:53,130
(Leonard:)Nothing, it's what's wrong with him.

10
00:00:53,301 --> 00:00:56,341
- It's exactly the same...
- Penny, Penny.

11
00:00:56,513 --> 00:00:57,643
(Leonard:)I know what to do.

12
00:00:58,932 --> 00:01:00,722
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I have some bad news.

